  "prefLabel": "Gen 402.02 License Renewal Application Packet",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 402.02 License Renewal Application Packet. Applicants for license renewal shall submit the following components of the application packet:\n\n(a) The completed renewal application form as specified in Plc 308.05;\n\n(b) The documents described in Gen 402.03(a), but no documents proving maintenance of continuing competence; and\n\n(c) The fee(s) specified by Plc 1002.18.\n\nSource. #10687, eff 10-7-14; ss by #13556, eff 4-11-23 (formerly Gen 402.03) (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Gen 400); ss by #14338, eff 10-7-25, EXPIRES: 10-7-35 (formerly Gen 402.03)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen400.html"
